{
  "uid": "tailnet-devices",
  "title": "终端设备 — tailnet",
  "description": "手机、笔记本这些进进出出的设备。和 Fleet 总览分开:服务器缺席是故障,这里缺席是常态,所以这一屏刻意不做任何'是否在线'的健康判断。由 nix 声明式下发,见 nixos/modules/monitoring。",
  "tags": ["fleet", "nix", "tailnet"],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "user",
        "label": "归属",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(tailscale_peer_online{kind=\"device\"}, user)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "概览",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "此刻在线",
      "description": "设备总数二十来台,任意时刻通常只有三五台在线 —— 这是正常的,不是故障。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "count(max by(peer) (tailscale_peer_online{kind=\"device\",user=~\"$user\"}) == 1) or vector(0)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "窗口内出现过",
      "description": "所选时间范围内至少上线过一次的设备数。把范围拉大,下面矩阵的空格就会变少 —— 这一屏的填充度由时间范围决定,不是由此刻有几台在线决定。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 5, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "count(max by(peer) (max_over_time(tailscale_peer_online{kind=\"device\",user=~\"$user\"}[$__range])) == 1) or vector(0)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "none", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "正在走中继",
      "description": "本该直连却在经 DERP 中继的设备。这是这一屏最该看的数字 —— 手机在蜂窝网上四十毫秒是物理规律改不了,但走不走中继是能治的,而且中继意味着流量在过 h610 的家宽上行。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 10, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "count(max by(peer) (tailscale_peer_direct{kind=\"device\",user=~\"$user\"}) == 0) or vector(0)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "设备类型",
      "description": "窗口内出现过的设备按操作系统分布。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 9, "x": 15, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{os}}",
          "expr": "count by(os) (max by(peer, os) (max_over_time(tailscale_peer_online{kind=\"device\",user=~\"$user\"}[$__range])) == 1)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "pieType": "donut",
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "none", "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },

    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "延迟矩阵",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "设备 → 服务器 延迟(所选时间范围内的均值)",
      "description": "行 = 设备,列 = 服务器。\n\n**取的是时间窗均值,不是此刻快照。** 这些设备大部分时间不在线,拍一张快照的话矩阵基本全空、看着像坏了。改成窗口均值之后,一台昨天只在线二十分钟的手机照样有格子 —— 只有整个窗口内一次都没出现过的才是空的。想让矩阵更满就把右上角的时间范围拉大。\n\n测量方向是服务器 → 设备(手机和别人的 MacBook 上装不了任何 exporter),同一条路径上 RTT 基本对称。探不到时不写入样本,所以空格的含义是'这段时间没测到',不是'延迟为零'。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 11, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "avg_over_time(tailscale_device_rtt_seconds{user=~\"$user\"}[$__range]) * 1000"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true, "job": true, "__name__": true, "kind": true,
              "os": true, "user": true, "via": true, "region": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "groupingToMatrix",
          "options": {
            "columnField": "instance",
            "rowField": "peer",
            "valueField": "Value",
            "emptyValue": "empty"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm", "footer": { "show": false } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "align": "center", "cellOptions": { "type": "color-background", "mode": "gradient" } },
          "color": { "mode": "continuous-blues" },
          "noValue": "—"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "peer\\instance" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "auto" } },
              { "id": "custom.align", "value": "left" },
              { "id": "displayName", "value": "设备 \\ 服务器" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },

    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "在线规律",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "设备在线时间线",
      "description": "这一屏最重要的一张:它让上面矩阵里的空格变得有意义 —— 一眼看出某台设备是'那段时间根本不在'还是'在但测不到'。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{peer}}",
          "expr": "max by(peer) (tailscale_peer_online{kind=\"device\",user=~\"$user\"})"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "alignValue": "left",
        "rowHeight": 0.9,
        "legend": { "displayMode": "hidden", "showLegend": false },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 0, "fillOpacity": 80 },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "在线", "color": "green", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "离线", "color": "transparent", "index": 1 } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "transparent", "value": null }] },
          "noValue": "—"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },

    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "明细",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RTT 变化(断开处是真的没数据,不是零)",
      "description": "spanNulls 关掉了,所以设备离线期间线是断的而不是拉一条直线过去 —— 后者会让人误以为那段时间延迟很稳定。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 31 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{peer}} ← {{instance}}",
          "expr": "tailscale_device_rtt_seconds{user=~\"$user\"}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["mean", "max"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "points",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "当前路径与归属 DERP",
      "description": "只列此刻在线的设备。region 是承载流量的 DERP region;直连的设备这一列为空。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 31 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "max by(peer, user, os, via, region) (tailscale_device_rtt_seconds{user=~\"$user\"})"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "Value": true, "job": true, "__name__": true, "instance": true },
            "renameByName": {
              "peer": "设备",
              "user": "归属",
              "os": "系统",
              "via": "路径",
              "region": "DERP"
            }
          }
        },
        { "id": "groupBy", "options": { "fields": {
            "设备": { "aggregations": [], "operation": "groupby" },
            "归属": { "aggregations": [], "operation": "groupby" },
            "系统": { "aggregations": [], "operation": "groupby" },
            "路径": { "aggregations": [], "operation": "groupby" },
            "DERP": { "aggregations": [], "operation": "groupby" }
        } } }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm", "footer": { "show": false } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" } }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "路径" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-text" } },
              { "id": "mappings", "value": [
                  { "type": "value", "options": { "direct": { "text": "直连", "color": "green", "index": 0 } } },
                  { "type": "value", "options": { "derp": { "text": "中继", "color": "orange", "index": 1 } } }
                ] }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
